  "findings": {
    "latency": "the warm p95 gate (<10 s) is met by every artifact on the engine by more than an order of magnitude (574-671 ms); a full 150-case run takes about two minutes where candle on CPU took an hour",
    "accuracy": "neither artifact meets the 0.95 accuracy gate or zero false passes; every remaining false pass is an abstention-trap variant (ambiguous final-stage wording, or a status word with no exit evidence); gpt-oss-20b halves the false passes (3) and doubles the trap score (11/22) relative to the coder",
    "determinism": "warm repeats are bit-identical on Metal once the supervisor sends cache_prompt=false and a fixed seed; with prompt-cache reuse one case (bt-014) diverged",
